    {
      "externalId": "waivy:bake-lemon-crinkle-cookies",
      "slug": "bake-lemon-crinkle-cookies",
      "title": "Zitrone Crinkle Cookies",
      "instructions": "Soft, chewy Zitrone cookies bright mit frisch zest und juice, rolled in granulated dann powdered Zucker so they crack in snowy crinkles as they backen. Tangy, tender, und barely süß at der edges.",
      "prepTimeMinutes": 20,
      "cookTimeMinutes": 12,
      "storageInstructions": null,
      "reheatingInstructions": null,
      "cheapTips": [
        "frisch lemons do double duty here: zest für flavor und juice für tang, so two lemons replace any need für bottled extract.",
        "Chilling der Teig is free und non-negotiable; warm Teig spreads flat und loses der crinkle, wasting dein ingredients.",
        "ausrollen in granulated Zucker before der powdered Zucker; it keeps der powder aus dissolving in der Teig so der cracks stay bright white."
      ],
      "substitutions": [
